<title>POLAND: BPH AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 14.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>BPH AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 14.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit					 14.10 vs   19.52</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   33.52 vs   30.52</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 50.88 vs   44.97</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	79.30 vs   89.64</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit					191.91 vs  173.79</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  289.30 vs  257.78</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		433.51 vs  341.85</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     680.76 vs  671.15</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Przemyslowo-Handlowy SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
